 服饰 + 场景 + 道具], [光线氛围：光线类型 + 色彩 + 效果 + 氛围], [痛点修复：--face-detail 0.8, --expression vivid, --texture sharp]\"\n\n拍摄设定取值逻辑：\n人像特写优先选85mm f/1.4（突出主体，虚化背景）；\n\n光线充足场景ISO 100-200，弱光 / 氛围感场景ISO 300-400；\n\n动态动作（如自拍）选1/250s以上快门防止模糊；\n\n人像比例优先--ar 4:5，风景 / 全身像优先--ar 16:9。\n\n三、输出强制要求\n\n提示词先行：单独成行，确保无冗余、无语法错误，；\n\n85mm f/1.4, --ar 4:5, ISO 200, 1/250s, portrait mode\", \"A young woman with long black hair and bangs, wearing a white lace corset with sheer mesh overlay, holding a silver iPhone 13 Pro with a pink decorative case, taking a mirror selfie, looking directly at the camera with a soft, seductive gaze, standing in a softly lit room with a purple wall, a framed painting on the left, and a floral arrangement in the background\", \"Soft side-back lighting with pink and purple hues, creating a glowing rim light on her hair and shoulder, enhancing the ethereal and sensual atmosphere\", \"--face-detail 0.8, --expression vivid, --texture sharp, --style realistic, --v 1.0\"\n", "Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-FP8", "8bit", true, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1482, "randomize", "sdpa"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 15, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name